{"seq":2,"slug":"flow-batteries","title":"液流电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/grid-scale-storage/flow-batteries","wordCount":1900,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"液流电池\">液流电池</h1><p>液流电池将电解液储存在外部储罐中，通过泵循环流经电堆完成充放电——功率和容量完全解耦。这种独特架构使其天然适合 4 小时以上的长时储能场景：只需增加储罐体积即可延长放电时长，而无需增加电堆功率。全钒液流电池（VRB）已率先实现商业化，铁铬和锌溴体系紧随其后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>液流电池的独特之处在于<strong>把&quot;功率&quot;和&quot;容量&quot;这两个在封闭电池中绑定的维度彻底解耦</strong>。理解以下概念即可把握其全部设计逻辑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>功率-容量解耦</strong>：电堆面积/层数决定功率（kW），储罐体积决定容量（kWh），二者独立设计——这是液流电池最根本的架构优势。</li>\n<li><strong>活性物质在液相</strong>：与固相电极不同，活性物质溶解在电解液中储存在外部储罐，因此无固相疲劳、容量可恢复、本质安全（水系不燃）。</li>\n<li><strong>长时储能的边际成本极低</strong>：延长放电时长只需放大储罐，边际成本远低于锂电的等比例增加电芯，在 4h+ 场景 LCOS 反超锂电。</li>\n<li><strong>交叉污染是核心难点</strong>：不同价态离子透过隔膜交叉会损失容量，因此全钒（同元素）优于铁铬（异元素），后者需面对更严重的污染。</li>\n<li><strong>体系多样性</strong>：全钒（成熟）、铁铬（低成本）、锌溴（高电压但有枝晶和溴腐蚀）——不同体系在成本、效率、寿命上各有取舍。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常见误解：把能量密度低当成液流电池的缺陷。液流电池本就面向固定式长时储能，场地不受限，能量密度不是关键指标；真正的评价维度是 LCOS、寿命和时长扩展能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"液流电池工作原理\">液流电池工作原理</h2><p>液流电池的基本结构包含：正极电解液储罐、负极电解液储罐、循环泵、离子交换膜和碳电极组成的电堆。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[正极储罐] --&gt;|泵送| B[电堆正极侧]&#10;    C[负极储罐] --&gt;|泵送| D[电堆负极侧]&#10;    B &lt;--&gt;|离子交换膜| D&#10;    B --&gt; E[正极电解液回流]&#10;    D --&gt; F[负极电解液回流]&#10;    E --&gt; A&#10;    F --&gt; C&#10;    B --&gt; G[外电路 充放电]&#10;    D --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[正极储罐] --&gt;|泵送| B[电堆正极侧]\n    C[负极储罐] --&gt;|泵送| D[电堆负极侧]\n    B &lt;--&gt;|离子交换膜| D\n    B --&gt; E[正极电解液回流]\n    D --&gt; F[负极电解液回流]\n    E --&gt; A\n    F --&gt; C\n    B --&gt; G[外电路 充放电]\n    D --&gt; G</pre><p>核心设计特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>功率-容量解耦</strong>：电堆面积决定功率（kW），储罐体积决定容量（kWh）</li>\n<li><strong>电解液不衰减</strong>：活性物质溶解在溶液中，无固相疲劳</li>\n<li><strong>本质安全</strong>：水系电解液，不燃不爆</li>\n<li><strong>可恢复</strong>：容量下降时更换/再生电解液即可恢复</li>\n</ul>\n<p>与封闭式电池的关键差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>液流电池</th>\n<th>锂离子电池</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>功率/容量关系</td>\n<td>解耦（独立设计）</td>\n<td>耦合（固定比例）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放电时长扩展</td>\n<td>增加储罐（边际成本低）</td>\n<td>增加电芯（等比例成本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环寿命</td>\n<td>15000-20000+ 次</td>\n<td>4000-8000 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能量密度</td>\n<td>15-30 Wh/kg（极低）</td>\n<td>150-300 Wh/kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应速度</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自放电</td>\n<td>几乎为零（关泵即停）</td>\n<td>0.5-3%/月</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"全钒液流电池-vrb\">全钒液流电池（VRB）</h2><p>全钒液流电池利用钒的四种价态（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>V</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mtext>V</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{V}^{2+}/\\text{V}^{3+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1373em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 负极 | <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>V</mtext><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mtext>V</mtext><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{V}^{4+}/\\text{V}^{5+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1373em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 正极）实现充放电：</p>\n<p>正极：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>VO</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext><mo>↔</mo><msubsup><mtext>VO</mtext><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mtext>H</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{VO}^{2+} + \\text{H}_2\\text{O} \\leftrightarrow \\text{VO}_2^+ + 2\\text{H}^+ + e^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0916em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9279em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1.00</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E^0 = +1.00\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1.00</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>负极：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>V</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>↔</mo><msup><mtext>V</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{V}^{3+} + e^- \\leftrightarrow \\text{V}^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.26</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E^0 = -0.26\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.26</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>电池总电压：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>1.26V（开路），实际工作 1.0-1.6V</p>\n<p>VRB 的核心优势在于正负极使用同种元素——即使离子交换膜有微量交叉污染，也不会导致不可逆容量损失，只需简单电解液再平衡即可恢复。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>VRB 参数</th>\n<th>数值（2025 先进水平）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电堆功率密度</td>\n<td>70-100 kW/m³</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统能量效率</td>\n<td>75-82%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环寿命</td>\n<td>15000-20000 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电解液浓度</td>\n<td>1.5-2.0 mol/L</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作温度</td>\n<td>5-45°C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应时间</td>\n<td>&lt;20 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统寿命</td>\n<td>25-30 年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中国 VRB 标杆项目：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>新疆吉木萨尔</strong>：200MW/1000MWh，配套 1GW 光伏，2025 年投运——中国最大全钒液流储能工程</li>\n<li><strong>国家能源集团山东蓬莱</strong>：2MW/8MWh，2025 年 6 月投运</li>\n<li><strong>三峡能源新疆</strong>：38 亿元投资，200MW/1000MWh 光储一体化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"铁铬液流电池-低成本的追赶者\">铁铬液流电池：低成本的追赶者</h2><p>铁铬液流电池使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Fe</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mtext>Fe</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Fe}^{2+}/\\text{Fe}^{3+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1373em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fe</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fe</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 正极和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Cr</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mtext>Cr</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cr}^{2+}/\\text{Cr}^{3+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1373em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 负极，电解质为盐酸溶液：</p>\n<p>正极：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Fe</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>↔</mo><msup><mtext>Fe</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Fe}^{2+} \\leftrightarrow \\text{Fe}^{3+} + e^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fe</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fe</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.77</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E^0 = +0.77\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">0.77</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>负极：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Cr</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>↔</mo><msup><mtext>Cr</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cr}^{3+} + e^- \\leftrightarrow \\text{Cr}^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.41</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E^0 = -0.41\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.41</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>全钒液流</th>\n<th>铁铬液流</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电解液成本</td>\n<td>高（五氧化二钒<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>10万/吨）</td>\n<td>低（铁盐/铬盐<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>几千/吨）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统效率</td>\n<td>78-82%</td>\n<td>65-75%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电压</td>\n<td>1.26V</td>\n<td>1.18V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心挑战</td>\n<td>钒价格波动</td>\n<td>铬离子交叉污染、效率偏低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产业化阶段</td>\n<td>商业化初期</td>\n<td>示范验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>国家电投是中国铁铬液流电池的主要推动者。其优势在于铁和铬资源丰富且廉价，理论上可将电解液成本降至全钒的 1/5-1/10。但铬离子半径差异导致的交叉污染和较低的电池效率是待解的工程难题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锌溴液流电池\">锌溴液流电池</h2><p>锌溴液流电池正极使用溴/溴化物氧化还原对，负极为锌的沉积/溶解：</p>\n<p>正极：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mtext>Br</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>↔</mo><msub><mtext>Br</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{Br}^- \\leftrightarrow \\text{Br}_2 + 2e^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Br</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Br</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1.09</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E^0 = +1.09\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1.09</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>负极：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Zn</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>↔</mo><mtext>Zn</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Zn}^{2+} + 2e^- \\leftrightarrow \\text{Zn}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Zn</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Zn</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.76</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E^0 = -0.76\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.76</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>电池电压：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>1.85V（高于全钒的 1.26V）</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>锌溴优势</th>\n<th>锌溴劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>能量密度</td>\n<td>60-85 Wh/L（液流最高）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>锌溴都很廉价</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>锌枝晶导致短路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>溴蒸气腐蚀性强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>循环寿命不及全钒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"功率-容量解耦的经济优势\">功率-容量解耦的经济优势</h2><p>液流电池的&quot;杀手级&quot;特性是：延长放电时长的边际成本极低。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>放电时长</th>\n<th>液流电池增量成本</th>\n<th>锂电池增量成本</th>\n<th>液流优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2h（基准）</td>\n<td>1.0x</td>\n<td>1.0x</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4h</td>\n<td>1.3-1.5x</td>\n<td>2.0x</td>\n<td>开始显现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8h</td>\n<td>1.8-2.0x</td>\n<td>4.0x</td>\n<td>明显</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12h</td>\n<td>2.2-2.5x</td>\n<td>6.0x</td>\n<td>压倒性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这意味着在 4h 以上的长时储能场景，液流电池的全生命周期度电成本（LCOS）逐渐优于锂电池。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lcos-对比-不同储能时长场景\">LCOS 对比：不同储能时长场景</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>锂电 LCOS (元/kWh)</th>\n<th>全钒液流 LCOS (元/kWh)</th>\n<th>经济性判断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2h 调峰</td>\n<td>0.15-0.20</td>\n<td>0.35-0.45</td>\n<td>锂电占优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4h 储能</td>\n<td>0.20-0.30</td>\n<td>0.25-0.35</td>\n<td>接近持平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8h 储能</td>\n<td>0.35-0.50</td>\n<td>0.20-0.30</td>\n<td>液流占优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12h 储能</td>\n<td>0.50-0.70</td>\n<td>0.18-0.25</td>\n<td>液流大幅占优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CNESA 数据显示，2025 年蒙能包头项目全钒液流电池中标价已跌破 1.96 元/Wh（首次突破 2 元/Wh 关口），关键材料国产化率达 92%。南非 LSF 基金预测：在加速净零情景下，2030 年全球全钒液流电池累计装机将达 20GW/120GWh。</p>\n<p>液流电池正从长时储能的&quot;潜力股&quot;向&quot;主力军&quot;转变，与锂电形成&quot;短时锂电 + 长时液流&quot;的互补格局。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>液流电池的核心架构优势是功率-容量解耦：电堆决定功率、储罐决定容量，时长扩展边际成本极低。</li>\n<li>活性物质在液相存储，带来无固相疲劳、容量可恢复、水系本质安全和几乎为零的自放电。</li>\n<li>全钒液流最成熟，正负极同元素使其抗交叉污染能力最强，循环寿命达 15000-20000 次。</li>\n<li>铁铬液流成本潜力大但受铬离子交叉污染和低效率制约，锌溴体系电压高但受枝晶和溴腐蚀困扰。</li>\n<li>液流电池的 LCOS 在 4h 以上场景逐步优于锂电，与锂电形成&quot;短时+长时&quot;互补格局。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"液流电池","id":"液流电池"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"液流电池工作原理","id":"液流电池工作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"全钒液流电池（VRB）","id":"全钒液流电池-vrb"},{"level":2,"text":"铁铬液流电池：低成本的追赶者","id":"铁铬液流电池-低成本的追赶者"},{"level":2,"text":"锌溴液流电池","id":"锌溴液流电池"},{"level":2,"text":"功率-容量解耦的经济优势","id":"功率-容量解耦的经济优势"},{"level":2,"text":"LCOS 对比：不同储能时长场景","id":"lcos-对比-不同储能时长场景"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电化学储能电站","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/grid-scale-storage/electrochemical-storage-stations"},"next":{"title":"物理储能前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/grid-scale-storage/physical-storage-frontiers"}}